:"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"0LXOR8YXi5hk-afFcdWARQ","review_id":"kIDhcLqpDCNBhrxhqx6zUA","date":"2013-11-09T03:22:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9234246015548706,"text_excerpt":"Great place to grab a drink and hear some good live music in the Quarter. Prices are reasonable for Bourbon Street and there's a decent sized dance floor. Nothing fancy, but you can hear yourself talk during the day even when the band is playing. The test tube shot girls aren't quite as pushy as some other places, which is a blessing in itself. I always come here at least twice a day on my trips to New Orleans."},{"business_id":"0LXOR8YXi5hk-afFcdWARQ","review_id":"C5ANyjdqCdScKmJTHOE0vg","date":"2011-07-25T02:47:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9054161906242371,"text_excerpt":"Old Opera House is one of many bars on Bourbon with live music, staff is decent. Band plays 70's - 90's rock. Pros - usually not packed, band is very good, bar service is usually very good. Cons - Extremely loud, the band plays a set list (probably a hundred songs long) and really does not change much. Not much seating, expect to stand."},{"business_id":"0LXOR8YXi5hk-afFcdWARQ","review_id":"dQxd-M6sD2C5FVTT89CmBA","date":"2009-10-26T06:13:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8963791131973267,"text_excerpt":"here's some tips about the olde opera house. by day, they are one of the few clubs that offers zydeco. the house band? are really great. Bands that play there don't get paid a whole lot of money, so make sure you tip these guys... they deserve it. also, during the day the drinks are usually two for one. At night? WAY overpriced... but then again, you are on bourbon street, and like all bourbon street bars, they almost always are a little more expensive. I can only imagine the rent. At night, no zydeco, only cover bands. If you like that kind of thing? they do it very well. you'll find that bourbon never has original music at night in the majority of clubs. the opera house is no exception,..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"0LXOR8YXi5hk-afFcdWARQ","photo_id":"1ZtbLQqCn5LkM3CmHd3UEA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/1ZtbLQqCn5LkM3CmHd3UEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.932233452796936},{"business_id":"0LXOR8YXi5hk-afFcdWARQ","photo_id":"ePpDP9x2q5-fJ9b1pGzOWA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ePpDP9x2q5-fJ9b1pGzOWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8584026098251343},{"business_id":"0LXOR8YXi5hk-afFcdWARQ","photo_id":"Gjs44wfVdQJo45MCoFM9IA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Gjs44wfVdQJo45MCoFM9IA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.84465491771698},{"business_id":"0LXOR8YXi5hk-afFcdWARQ","photo_id":"mE1SZY9xUz3Q6RkpQ6lx4g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mE1SZY9xUz3Q6RkpQ6lx4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.844649612903595},{"business_id":"0LXOR8YXi5hk-afFcdWARQ","photo_id":"U5seyxedlcY034apNM2xyA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/U5seyxedlcY034apNM2xyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7863618731498718}]},"notebook_case":null}
